    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="errata">

                <pb facs="1120" n="1096" xml:id="pg1096"/>

                <head>Errata</head>
                <p>The following error has been identified in <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign
                        Relations of the United States, 1961–1963, Volume XXIV, Laos Crisis</hi>.
                    Please be aware that printed volumes have not been revised.</p>
                <list type="simple">
                    <item>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">1. <ref target="#d83">Document 83</ref>, Page 184
                            (date of errata entry: March 29, 2019)</hi>
                    </item>
                    <item>The location in the dateline of Document 83 has been corrected from “Olso”
                        to “Oslo”.</item>
                    <item>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">2. <ref target="#d466-f2">Document 466, Footnote
                                1</ref>, Page 1001 (date of errata entry: September 23, 2021)</hi>
                    </item>
                    <item>The reference to <ref target="frus:frus1961-63v06/d94">Document 94</ref>
                        is in error. Telegram 2273 is <ref target="frus:frus1961-63v06/d97">Document
                            97</ref>.</item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
